"    lpd://hostname/queue\n"
"\n"
"    socket://hostname\n"
"    socket://hostname:9100\n"
"</PRE>\n"
"\n"
"<P>See <A HREF=\"/help/network.html\" TARGET=\"_blank\">\"Network\n"
"Printers\"</A> for the correct URI to use with your printer.</P>\n"
"</TD>\n"
"</TR>\n"
"</TABLE>"
msgstr ""
"<TABLE>\n"
"<TR>\n"
"<TD>ឧទាហរណ៍ ៖\n"
"<PRE>\n"
"    http://hostname:631/ipp/\n"
"    http://hostname:631/ipp/port1\n"
"\n"
"    ipp://hostname/ipp/\n"
"    ipp://hostname/ipp/port1\n"
"\n"
"    lpd://hostname/queue\n"
"\n"
"    socket://hostname\n"
"    socket://hostname:9100\n"
"</PRE>\n"
"\n"
"<P>មើល <A HREF=\"/help/network.html\" TARGET=\"_blank\">\"ម៉ាស៊ីន​បោះពុម្ព​បណ្ដាញ\n"
"\"</A> សម្រាប់​ URI ត្រឹមត្រូវ​ ដើម្បី​ប្រើ​ជាមួយ​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បោះពុម្ព​របស់អ្នក ។</P>\n"
"</TD>\n"
"</TR>\n"
"</TABLE>"

